{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/915904-chilling-tales-to-astound-and-horrify-101-pulp-style-hooks","id":915904,"title":"Chilling Tales to Astound and Horrify!: 101 Pulp-Style Hooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-16T16:11:45-07:00","id":915904,"title":"Chilling Tales to Astound and Horrify!: 101 Pulp-Style Hooks","content":"Exactly what it says on the tin. If it belongs in an awesomely cheesy retro horror comic or magazine, it belongs here. <br /> <br /> 1. The Incredible Nuclear Men vs. The Malevolent Mutant Moon Menace!: An Idigam that fell to wash in the middle of a Firestorm has come to style itself as a &quot;patron&quot; of Flux and Centimani, like a perverse Qashmallim. It's taken over a remote research station, and after biding its time and amassing a small army of mutated monsters, it's ready to expand, and it considers any Prometheans it runs into to be either meals or minions. <br /> <br /> 2. The Weird Weird West!: Sixguns and Sarcophagi: A train carrying a mysterious cargo from a New York museum has crashed under mysterious circumstances in the midst of the badlands, and treasure hunters and fortune seekers from all over the west are willing to brave the unusually fearsome sandstorms for a shot at what supposedly could be the most valuable treasure ever transported by rail. But what about the rumors of a curse...or the tall dark stranger in the bandages, with the horse that never blinks and the guns that never go empty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T20:49:07-07:00","id":916010,"title":"","content":"3: The Lost Kingdom of Prester John!: Stories are circulating that relics of a strange build are being sighted in the distance in a deserted region of Saudi Arabia's Empty Quarter. The Church has ordered your cell to form up and travel through the dangerous orient to seek out and potentially find possible proof of the long lost kingdom of Prester John. Mad cults, witch covens, and lost dangers await, but working in the service of God grants great favor to those who do His work.<br /> <br /> 4: Dangerous Dwarves of the High Rockies!: Cars are vanishing around the Rocky Mountains, and the few who make their way back to civilization cry out that their cars were attacked by little men wielding bows and arrows, even tomahawks! The local sheriffs trot them quietly away to the rubber rooms, but you know better. A long trip is in order to the snowy heights of the American backbone, to hunt down whatever thinks it can just snatch people out of their own cars!<br /> <br /> 5: Bloodsucking Madams of the Nation's Capital!: Lurid tales are sweeping through the hunter underground about senators, congressmen, and bureaucrats being latched onto by one of the most infamous houses of ill-repute in the city. The police officials won't do a thing to shut it down, meaning it's up to you and yours to stomp out the problem before it infests anywhere else in the hallowed halls of government!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T09:52:22-07:00","id":916284,"title":"","content":"6: Kill 'em One More Time...For Me: She came into your office, eyeliner smeared, dress lived in for more than a few days. She told you a mixed up yarn about her abusive husband. How he beat her, how he stayed out all night for days at a time. His best friend was her only comfort, and the day that dear old hubby did enough damage to blind her in one eye, the best friend decided it was time to even the score. Said he put a bullet right between the sorry sack's eyes, and buried him in a field outside of town. Between sobs she tells you that now the best friend has gone missing, and the house is stinking of her old beau's cologne. She will pay your whatever you want to find out what is going on, so she can escape this nightmare once and for all. Damn, if she ain't pretty when she cries...(think 20's noir-pulp)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11942-the13thghost","name":"The13thGhost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11942_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T15:18:00-07:00","id":916457,"title":"","content":"7. Estate of an English Lady: A letter arrives at the homes of several people from exceedingly diverse backgrounds from around the world, and apparently they are all of relation to a lady Cumberdale through marriage of distant cousins. Lady Cumberdale has died and all those receiving letters are named her beneficiaries. In the letters are paid airline tickets and other travel expenses to a remote England estate for them and their entire immediate families, all addressed by name, to hear the reading of her will. Apparently her fortune was vast, and the letter makes it clear that everyone with a ticket must attend or the beneficiary closest related to the missing person will not receive their share. Why are these arrangements so oddly specific and unusual?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 06-17-2016, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T16:42:07-07:00","id":916485,"title":"","content":"8. Agent V - The Government's Most Secret Weapon! Who is responsible for the seemingly impossible killings of enemy spies and saboteurs? Bullets can't stop him! He can enter a sealed room as easily as a fine mist! No-one remembers even seeing him! Could it possibly be true that a vampire assassin works for the nation's greatest intelligence agency?!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T20:05:05-07:00","id":916581,"title":"","content":"9. Mr X and the Time Bandits! A rash of robberies leaves the nation puzzled. The Thieves are stealing all manor of unusual objects, and abducting seemingly random people. Then they swipe the countries famous landmarks right out from under the police! These are raiders are from the future and stealing anything from the past that might be valuable. Only one man can stop them - Mr. X, once an agent of temporal enforcement, now lone protector of the timeline and the innocent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T06:12:41-07:00","id":917980,"title":"","content":"10. Horror on the Orient Express!: On board the a luxurious train bound for Paris from Istanbul, the passengers drink, dance, and socialize the night away. Little do they know that not far away in the cargo hold an ancient evil stirs within the archaeological find of the decade! The night has become tainted, and now no one can be trusted. Will they be able to uncover those who are corrupted and put a stop to this evil before it makes its way to the City of Light? Will they survive at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11942-the13thghost","name":"The13thGhost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11942_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T06:59:03-07:00","id":918008,"title":"","content":"11: Lost Horrors of Atahualpa!: In the high mountain peaks of Peru, lost cities are being uncovered belonging to the once great Inca people. Left undisturbed for hundreds of years, these massive mountain metropolis mark a chance to uncover amazing archaeological relics and treasures. The time is right to load up your mules, hire shifty looking local guides, out-shoot your competitors, and uncover the reasons why these cities were abandoned in the first place for money, dames, and history!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T15:20:24-07:00","id":949568,"title":"","content":"12. The Battle for Eruption Island!: A new island in the pacific has been discovered, and its geography, particularly the enormous volcano in the center, make it the perfect location for a supervillain lair. Mad scientists from all over the world are amazing their forces to claim it! Will you sign up as a mercenary...or try to claim it for yourself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}